{"unit_id":"cestbonn__dsh-bilibili-radio#readme-4","repo":"cestbonn/dsh-bilibili-radio","commit":"7cc09ea9dbddf69eec244876dee7277c9d8acda4","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-bilibili-radio README · 安装：需要 [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) **0.2.2-rc.1+**（peer：`@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools`）。\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add ./dsh-bilibili-radio\n```\n\n从 GitHub：\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:cestbonn/dsh-bilibili-radio\n```\n\n装完重开 DSH。需要能访问 B 站。音源走本机 `127.0.0.1:13210` 代理。","source":"extracted","section":"安装"}
{"unit_id":"cestbonn__dsh-bilibili-radio#readme-5","repo":"cestbonn/dsh-bilibili-radio","commit":"7cc09ea9dbddf69eec244876dee7277c9d8acda4","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-bilibili-radio README · 功能：- **播放器**：一个简约的播放器。\n- **滚动歌词**：自动搜索歌词轨。\n- **歌单**：播放列表、我喜欢的、听歌排行、自定义歌单。\n- **发现**：B站各音乐榜单、相关推荐、搜索歌曲/up主。\n- **收藏 UP**：收藏常听的 UP。\n- **大肥鱼**：想听什么，让大肥鱼操作；找歌、操作歌单、切歌等。","source":"extracted","section":"功能"}
